Feature: Petstore API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet (POST)\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    And the request payload is provided for a new pet\n    When I send a POST request to the endpoint\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the created pet details\n\n  Scenario: Retrieve a pet by ID (GET)\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/{petId}\"\n    And a valid pet ID is provided\n    When I send a GET request to the endpoint\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the pet details\n\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet (PUT)\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    And the request payload is provided for updating a pet\n    When I send a PUT request to the endpoint\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the updated pet details\n\n  Scenario: Delete a pet by ID (DELETE)\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/{petId}\"\n    And a valid pet ID is provided\n    When I send a DELETE request to the endpoint\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should confirm the pet is deleted